# SIMD vectors: construct from a block, elementwise ops, reduce, lane extract.
[ 1 2 3 4 ] vi [ 10 20 30 40 ] vi va .       # vi(11 22 33 44)
[ 5 5 5 5 ] vi [ 1 2 3 4 ] vi vs .           # vi(4 3 2 1)
[ 1.0 2.0 3.0 4.0 ] vf [ 2 2 2 2 ] vf vm .   # vf(2 4 6 8)
[ 1 2 3 4 ] vi vh .                           # 10  (horizontal sum)
[ 7 8 9 10 ] vi 2 at .                         # 9   (lane 2)
